{"id":"vod_sn_35674","vodId":"35674","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"彗星路西法","name_cn":"彗星路西法","date":"2015-01-01","year":"2015","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/44148664beba24dc402d7823eb404425.jpg"},"summary":"《彗星路西法》讲述闪耀着蓝色光辉的矿石吉夫特矿石所覆盖的大地，行星吉夫特。宗吾天城是住在因吉夫特矿石采掘而繁荣的小镇，靛蓝花园的纯朴少年。以收集稀少矿石为乐趣的宗吾，某天被卷入同级生卡恩、罗曼、欧特等人引发的骚动，迷失在矿山深处的地底湖。在那里，宗吾遇到了一位不可思议的少女随风飘逸的蓝色长发，直直凝视的红色瞳孔。她究竟是什么人，这次邂逅给宗吾带来了什么？随后，缔结的羁绊将打开通往冒险的大门。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 15:36:42","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YkzVnEf0Xk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Knqx32n17T1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/YSZvXN9h0k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4ejt9StR7b1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/03TDrw5LEr1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/PkQwJWVSn81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ygK7JzeK311/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/gESp3Ln9Sz1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Q8a1rUuSt11/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cfC2ujcGzc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4U91gHAWUM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cdFCnTY30W1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:45:32.175Z"}